  icon: {fileID: 2800000, guid: 9266273b8f123004195741f969177dda, type: 3}
  title: Data
  sections:
  - heading: What is this folder ?
    text: This folder is dedicated to objects that purely contain data. These objects
      are useful for game designers, to tweak and configure things easily.
    linkText: 
    url: 
  - heading: Why are things categorized by asset type rather than by topic ?
    text: Scriptable Objects are stored by type here, because their type usually
      corresponds to exactly the game concepts they relate to (ingredients, recipes,
      clients, etc....). And just as art is separated from audio and scripts, data
      is separated from the rest because it conforms with the MVC pattern.
    linkText: 
    url: 
  loadedLayout: 1
